<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>tell me, will we survive?</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">PRYVT, hanuel, HNATA</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">tell me, will we survive?</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2TksKegWgcUKDpiG5sTY44</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.579" end="00:22.960">I don't wanna pretend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.960" end="00:26.535">But you won't listen, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.535" end="00:30.252">You don't understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.252" end="00:33.624">밤이 참 힘들어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.624" end="00:37.235">희미하게 들려</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.235" end="00:40.523">너의 목소리 부터</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.523" end="00:45.284">향기 까지 떠올라</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.284" end="00:48.812">Sleepless night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.812" end="00:52.328">You're on my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.328" end="00:55.862">Tell me, how</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.862" end="00:59.352">Will we survive?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.352" end="01:02.870">Lonely night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.870" end="01:06.483">Tears in my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.483" end="01:09.962">How about you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.962" end="01:17.962">You like me too?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.229" end="01:33.759">Calling me friend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.759" end="01:37.364">It doesn't make sense</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.364" end="01:40.522">You want me still</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.522" end="01:43.891">But I don't want you now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.891" end="01:47.552">Or so that's what I thought</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.552" end="01:52.067">어딜 가도 너가 떠오르는걸건</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.067" end="01:54.984">Don't know why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.984" end="02:02.030">Left me with my misery</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.030" end="02:10.010">Can we turn our time back around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.010" end="02:13.421">Sleepless night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.421" end="02:16.868">You're on my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.868" end="02:20.436">Tell me, how</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.436" end="02:23.985">Will we survive? (Will we survive)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.985" end="02:27.485">Lonely night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.485" end="02:31.031">Tears in my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.031" end="02:34.581">How about you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.581" end="02:38.581">You like me too?</p></div></body></tt>